    <string name="captantan_bar_capture_unsupported">System-key capture needs Android 16 QPR2 or later</string>
    <string name="captantan_key_capture">Send system shortcuts to the remote</string>
    <string name="captantan_key_capture_summary">While the session has focus, the Windows key, Alt+Tab, Ctrl+Esc, Alt+F4 and the like go to the remote machine instead of Android. Android keeps a few (Home, Meta+D, Meta+H, power, volume, and Ctrl+Space while it switches Android\'s keyboard language), and a long press on Escape is Android\'s way out of the window. Needs Android 16 QPR2 or later.</string>
