    <string name="captantan_bar_note">Docked: the bar is a toolbar across the top, and the remote desktop ends where it begins. In full screen it is gone (rest the mouse pointer at the edge to see it for a moment), unless it is kept there; Back leaves full screen. Overlay: the bar floats over the remote desktop at the edge you choose, in full screen too. Edge and opacity are for overlay only.</string>
